# UI: No Python Quality Gates
RULE: UI repos use TypeScript quality gates only: tsc, ESLint, Playwright. No Python tools (uv, basedpyright, pytest, ruff).
WHY: UIs are TypeScript-only; Python quality gates are irrelevant and cause confusion.
CODEX: 05-infrastructure/ui-setup-checklist.md
DO: Use tsc --noEmit for type checking; ESLint for linting; Vitest for unit tests; Playwright for E2E tests; npm/pnpm for dependencies
NEVER: uv pip install in UI repos; basedpyright in UI quality gates; pytest in UI tests; Python dependencies in UI repos
